<title>FRANCE: MOTOR RACING-LE MANS 24-HOUR RACE QUALIFYING TIMES.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-LE MANS 24-HOUR RACE QUALIFYING TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>LE MANS, France 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qualifying times on Thursday for this weekend's Le Mans 24-hour race:</p>
<p>1. Michele Alboreto (Italy) Joest Porsche Prototype three minutes 41.581 seconds (average speed 220.958 kph)</p>
<p>2. Thierry Boutsen (Belgium) Porsche 911 3:44.234</p>
<p>3. J.J. Lehto (Finland) BMW McLaren F1 3:45.402</p>
<p>4. Emmanuel Collard (France) Porsche 911 3:45.490</p>
<p>5. Christophe Bouchut (France) Kremer Porsche 911 3:46.389</p>
<p>6. Max Papis (Italy) Ferrari 330SP Prototype 3:46.431</p>
<p>7. Eric van de Poele (Belgium) Nissan R390 3:46.670</p>
<p>8. Pierluigi Martini (Italy) BMS Porsche 911 3:46.907</p>
<p>9. Gary Ayles (Britain) Lark McLaren F1 3:47.108</p>
<p>10. Karl Wendlinger (Austria) Roock Porsche 911 3:47.314</p>
</text>
